discussion_comments.comment_body:
For searching the Fiber tree you don't need recursion. You can walk Fibers iteratively


```suggestion
  function findByHostInstance(
    internals: RendererInternals,
    root: Fiber,
    hostInstance: mixed,
  ): Fiber | null {
    let current = root;
    while (true) {
      if (getHostInstanceForFiber(internals, current) === hostInstance) {
        return current;
      }

      if (current.child !== null) {
        current = current.child;
        continue;
      }

      while (current !== root && current.sibling === null) {
        current = current.return;
      }
      if (current === root) {
        return null;
      }
      current = current.sibling;
    }
  }

